Drive away
Further from the city lights
Stay awake
Falling in the arms of night
Tired eyes
Hollow thoughts
Standing on a solid ground
So much time being lost
Leaving far where won’t be found
Drive away
Further from the city life
Stay awake
Falling in the arms of wild
Feeling tired
Feelings lost
Standing on a frozen ground
Without truth
There’s no trust
To the place where won’t be found
Close your eyes
Sound of purity
